+       row  `Str`  `String()`

-       row  `Whole`  `Integer()`
+       row  `Whole`  `Integer()`

-       row  `Real`  `Number()`
+       row  `Real`  `Number()`

-       row  `Bool`  `Boolean()`
+       row  `Bool`  `Boolean()`

-       row  `Empty`  `Null()`
+       row  `Empty`  `Null()`

-       row  `Any`, `Dict`  `Object(additionalProperties = true)`
+       row  `Any`, `Dict`  `Object(additionalProperties = true)`

-       row  `Opt(inner)`  the inner schema, marked optional
-       row  `Arr(items)`  an `Array`
-       row  `Obj(fields, required)`  an `Object` with those properties
-       row  `OneOf(variants)`  an `Object` whose `oneOf` lists them, with `kind` required
+       row  `Opt(inner)`  внутренняя схема, помеченная как опциональная
+       row  `Arr(items)`  `Array`
+       row  `Obj(fields, required)`  `Object` с этими свойствами
